---
import InfoPage from '../layouts/InfoPage.astro';
---
<InfoPage title="Contact Us | Musfira's" eyebrow="We'd Love to Hear From You" heading="Contact Us" description="Contact Musfira's for help with an order, product questions or feedback.">
      <p>Whether you have a question about a product, need help with an order, want to share feedback, or are interested in working with us &#8212; we welcome every message with genuine attention. The <span class="mfs-brand">Musfira's</span> team is always happy to help.</p>

      <p><strong>For help with an order</strong> &#8212; such as tracking, delivery, changing or cancelling an order, or a return or exchange &#8212; please write to us and include your <strong>Order ID</strong> (you will find it on your order confirmation and in our WhatsApp messages). This helps us find your order and assist you much faster.</p>

      <p><strong>For everything else</strong> &#8212; product questions, suggestions, collaborations, or simply to say hello &#8212; our inbox is always open.</p>

      <p>We read every message personally, and we genuinely appreciate the moment you take out of your day to write to us. A kind word, a helpful correction or a thoughtful suggestion for our next collection &#8212; it all matters, and it all helps us serve you better.</p>

      <div class="mfs-badges">
        <div class="mfs-badge">&#9993;&#65039; <a href="mailto:info@musfiras.com" class="mfs-email">info@musfiras.com</a></div>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top:14px;"><em>We aim to respond to every genuine inquiry as promptly as possible.</em></p>

      <p class="mfs-sign"><span class="mfs-brand">&#8212; Musfira's</span> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <span class="mfs-brand">Made to adore</span></p>

      <div class="mfs-disclosure">Please keep your Order ID handy when you contact us so our team can help you faster.</div>
</InfoPage>
